{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1744","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Even-Odd Increments "}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given $$$n$$$ of integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$. Process $$$q$$$ queries of two types:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" query of the form \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 $$$x_j$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\": add the value $$$x_j$$$ to all even elements of the array $$$a$$$,"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" query of the form \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1 $$$x_j$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\": add the value $$$x_j$$$ to all odd elements of the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that when processing the query, we look specifically at the odd/even value of $$$a_i$$$, not its index."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After processing each query, print the sum of the elements of the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please note that the answer for some test cases won't fit into 32-bit integer type, so you should use at least 64-bit integer type in your programming language (like "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"long long"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for C++)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains an integer $$$t$$$ $$$(1 \\leq t \\leq 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The descriptions of the test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n$$$, $$$q \\leq 10^5$$$) — the length of array $$$a$$$ and the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains exactly $$$n$$$ integers: $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a_i \\leq 10^9$$$) — elements of the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following $$$q$$$ lines contain queries as two integers $$$type_j$$$ and $$$x_j$$$ $$$(0 \\leq type_j \\leq 1$$$, $$$1 \\leq x_j \\leq 10^4$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of values $$$n$$$ over all test cases in a test does not exceed $$$10^5$$$. Similarly, the sum of values $$$q$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print $$$q$$$ numbers: the sum of the elements of the array $$$a$$$ after processing a query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n1 1\n1\n1 1\n3 3\n1 2 4\n0 2\n1 3\n0 5\n6 7\n1 3 2 4 10 48\n1 6\n0 5\n0 4\n0 5\n1 3\n0 12\n0 1\n6 7\n1000000000 1000000000 1000000000 11 15 17\n0 17\n1 10000\n1 51\n0 92\n0 53\n1 16\n0 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n11\n14\n29\n80\n100\n100\n100\n118\n190\n196\n3000000094\n3000060094\n3000060400\n3000060952\n3000061270\n3000061366\n3000061366\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, the array $$$a = [2]$$$ after the first query."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test case, the array $$$a$$$ is modified as follows: $$$[1, 3, 2, 4, 10, 48]$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$[7, 9, 2, 4, 10, 48]$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$[7, 9, 7, 9, 15, 53]$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$[7, 9, 7, 9, 15, 53]$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$[10, 12, 10, 12, 18, 56]$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$[22, 24, 22, 24, 30, 68]$$$ $$$\\rightarrow$$$ $$$[23, 25, 23, 25, 31, 69]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1744B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1744/problem/B"}